Local mode on a Mac that never added a server (rowt #s117): servers.json is
absent, and a vm.json is left from before the last server went. `render`
must write host.json, leave the VM guest config unrendered and remove the
stale one; `reload`, `restart` and `up local` must not refuse for want of
servers. The empty-pool twin is local-empty-pool (`[]`, no vm.json).
